Hi Jerome,

I have noticed when using the timer function with certain audio files the s.start and s.end positions appear to show the start and end positions of the pause rather than the signal. First is listed as "pause", when it is according to the graph as "signal". The amplitude value lies just below the threshold at the beginning of the file. I ran the following code:
path_name <- "C:\Users\User\Desktop\20150623_000002_Owl_05_28_18.wav"
wav_file <- readWave(filename = path_name)
a <- timer(wav_file,
           f=sampling_rate,
           threshold = 12,
           msmooth = c(window_length, overlap),
           power = 3.5)
a$s.start
a$s.end
The call of the owl in the file is very distant and hard to hear.

YvonneP

